<title>CANADA: Magna posts lower fourth-quarter earnings.</title>
<headline>Magna posts lower fourth-quarter earnings.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth quarter ended</p>
<p>July 31 for Magna International Inc.</p>
<p>		     1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr		 C$1.25		   C$1.36</p>
<p> Net		 86,100		   83,000</p>
<p> Revs		1,659,000		1,202,000</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 C$4.71		   C$5.16</p>
<p> Net		 309,000		  317,000</p>
<p> Revs		5,856,200		4,795,400</p>
<p>	 (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
